 "description": "This is a update of my Local Uprising deck that I used most of last year up to Dragon Con. This deck just keeps comeing back to the front of my mind and leeds me to this idea.",
 "strategy": "Okay first thing I know you will see is the Lack of sheilds in this deck. I fond that this deck didn't need them relly all that much as I took the first one throu 2 state's and a open quilifer this deck only picked up 2 loss in the events with one being a bit of slight of play by the Dark Side on me. This deck just seems to find a way to either stay alive and keep diferental down or win not by the biggest amounts but just win. Some of the Strongest cahnges are the drop of my two undercover spys in the deck Han and Leia. I went with a more comabtive Leia 'still have to find a weapon to use' and droped han from the deck 'don't want to just depend on han and have Jabba's Prize rob me of him' This deck never packed lando in the first place so the DS lando will not affect that. I changed the Insrection to the combo relly didn't need the +2 forfit all that offten. The space pakage is still the same with Bright hope Replceing out Inddependnce. I had droped the frist bite from the deck affter awhile and might aggin just not shure is it relly is worth it. All ways looking for ideas of this deck and welcome any and all to make sugestions. Fire at Will and happy hunting.",
